[20.2-24.2] spk0: I never got a summons in the mail, I swear to you!
[24.7-31.9] spk1: Regardless, to clear the arrest order while we investigate the mail, you must post a compliance bond immediately.
[32.4-35.6] spk0: Can I just drive down to the courthouse right now?
